UNIT @6:1
  PROG PROGRAM GENERATES @6:1
    DIVN IDENTIFICATION @6:1
      IDPA PROGRAM-ID GENERATES @7:1
    DIVN DATA @8:1
      SECT WORKING-STORAGE @9:1
        DATA 1 OUT-TEXT @10:1
          CLAU PICTURE X(200) @10:25
        DATA 1 REC @11:1
          DATA 5 A @12:5
            CLAU PICTURE X(4) @12:25
          DATA 5 B @13:5
            CLAU PICTURE 9(3) @13:25
    DIVN PROCEDURE @14:1
      SENT @15:5
        STMT XML @15:5
          BLCK EXCEPTION @20:9
            STMT DISPLAY @21:13
          BLCK NOT-EXCEPTION @22:9
            STMT DISPLAY @23:13
        STMT JSON @25:5
          BLCK EXCEPTION @26:9
            STMT DISPLAY @27:13
          BLCK NOT-EXCEPTION @28:9
            STMT DISPLAY @29:13
        STMT STOP @31:5
